### ext5 (.102) BackchannelStreamState today per hour (retry, was cut off)
grep "192.168.2.102" /var/log/cameras.log | grep -oE "^Sep 16 [0-9]{2}" | sort | uniq -c
### ext5 (.102) prudynt lines today
grep "192.168.2.102" /var/log/cameras.log | grep "^Sep 16" | tail -6
### ext2 (.105) audio death at 16:32 local: what does the SEGMENT data say (dBFS=0 all day, useless). Check ext2 h19/h20/h21 segcensus vs ext3
tail -5 /var/lib/aria-fleet/segcensus/exterior_5.log
### ext2 (.105) camera uptime (RSSI puller has uptime column)
tail -3 /var/lib/aria-fleet/rssi/exterior_2.log 2>/dev/null || ls /var/lib/aria-fleet/rssi/ 2>/dev/null
### ext2 (.105) ext5 (.102): uptime columns for all cams (reboot check)
for f in /var/lib/aria-fleet/rssi/*.log; do echo "== $f"; tail -1 "$f"; done 2>/dev/null | head -20